{"version":1,"content":"<p>葡萄牙零售商MegaPC的商品頁面出現Motorola Signature 27與Razr Flex兩款新機的價格。其中，Signature 27的12GB內存、512GB存儲版本標價1594.90歐元，配色為Pantone Coal Smoke；頁面顯示暫時缺貨，也沒有公佈發貨時間。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584146.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:21:47.153785+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:16:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:19.302048+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:19.302048+00:00","content_hash":"9714ae7102bc6d349677d6990afe61c9cab04ae1d4abb6c81d20dabcf905f73d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}